  "note": "The Ascent of Akrabbim already appears under עלה for the word ‘ascent’. Rehoboam’s speech leaves the construction of the threatened scourge unspecified. Kogan identifies Akkadian aqrabu in a late lexical list as a West Semitic borrowing. The Peshitta noun is SEDRA lexeme 2402."
